    "The same voice reappears, and Nulla tenses up instantly."

# game/rutas/memorias.rpy:88
translate ingles memoriasnulla_105740f8:

    # "Una figura tan blanca como la nieve se forma detrás del pelinegro, y permanece ahí, quieta; observandolos a ustedes dos sin hacer movimiento alguno. Como si de una imagen se tratase."
    "A figure as white as snow forms behind the dark-haired one, remaining still; watching the two of you without making a single movement. As if it were just an image."

# game/rutas/memorias.rpy:90
translate ingles memoriasnulla_964ea7fe:

    # "Nulla intenta ablanzarse hacia ti pero dos manos se materializan para evitarlo y como si el cuerpo de Nulla se tratase de un trapo, ambas manos desgarran los brazos del pelinegro sin mucho esfuero."
    "Nulla tries to lunge toward you, but two hands materialize to stop him, and as if his body were nothing but a rag, both hands tear his arms apart effortlessly."

# game/rutas/memorias.rpy:91
translate ingles memoriasnulla_5b83f6d4:

    # "Gritas su nombre"
    "You scream his name."

# game/rutas/memorias.rpy:92
translate ingles memoriasnulla_5cd4e3dc:

